        the retired 'Not Sent', so the path is re-sequenced to match: Prepare -> Review ->
        Approved -> Sent -> Signed, five steps instead of four.

        THE FORMER 'Not Sent' STEP IS REMOVED, NOT RENAMED. Its three fieldNames
        (Counterparty_Name__c, Party_Role__c, Method__c) move to the new Prepare step, since
