        path asks for - it is now done at Prepare instead of at the retired Not Sent.

        REVIEW AND APPROVED HAVE NO fieldNames, ON THE SAME REASONING AS Declined BELOW: NDA__c
        carries no field naming a reviewer, an approver, or a review/approval date, so there is
        nothing on the object for these two steps to surface. They are process gates, not data-
        entry steps - the same shape Declined already used for a different reason (see Declined's
