    <entityName>NDA__c</entityName>
    <fieldName>Status__c</fieldName>
    <masterLabel>NDA Path Disposition</masterLabel>
    <pathAssistantSteps>
        <fieldNames>Counterparty_Name__c</fieldNames>
        <fieldNames>Party_Role__c</fieldNames>
        <fieldNames>Method__c</fieldNames>
        <info>An interested party has been identified and the NDA is being drafted. Record who they are and whether this is the prospective Buyer or the Introducing Broker who brought them - DPEG collects one NDA per party.</info>
        <picklistValueName>Prepare</picklistValueName>
    </pathAssistantSteps>
    <pathAssistantSteps>
        <info>The drafted NDA has been checked internally and is approved to send. The counterparty still has not seen it - Sent is the next step, once it actually goes out to them.</info>
